[STRINGS]
C4TEXT = Victory!\n\nHell is defeated and the network is\nsafe.  And as for you?  Well, who\nknows where you are now ...\n\n\nAdam would like to thank:\niD software for this awesome game.\nNick Baker and submerge for the\ntextures used.\nAlfonzo, Jimmy, PRIMEVAL and\nSilent Zorah for music.\nDemon of the Well, Never_Again and\nSteveD for main playtesting duties.\nEveryone else who gave feedback.\nYou, for playing Doom404 :)
